":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"Rustは足周りの整ったCという印象なのでむしろ型が強くないと使い物にならない気もする","ts":"1625463533.211500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M3LKr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a93a7ccd-3325-4bc0-b53f-4f54d809cfe0","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"もちろん Rust のほうが圧倒的に堅いですが","ts":"1625463529.211300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pSE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0162ea3e-e409-48fd-b94b-8bfda184a3a3","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"JSに型を付けられるという意味では Rust 以上に推論強いですね","ts":"1625463501.210400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I0S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"768bc788-a36b-4ece-9efa-e07f81697896","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"Pythonは書くよりは、後からのチェックで事故ってないか確認できる、みたいな感じがする","ts":"1625463497.210100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jBu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eea1d219-5241-4eab-b9f4-2248d37d0432","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"型推論","ts":"1625463455.208400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a6WDH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5dd5e93-1f9b-42b2-b852-4e2722f228ff","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"何もなしで書き味がいいなら自分はRubyになるかも","ts":"1625463450.208100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6zX/a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"646ea271-c12d-41c3-9f6d-c8ea7f936e3c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Rust とかは強い印象","ts":"1625463449.208000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kBlY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"979d21ac-58c6-405a-8037-ffed34c00cdd","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"Python の型も頑張ってるけど TS と比べるとオモチャです","ts":"1625463435.207